<title>UK: CRICKET-STRANG REPLACES HOOPER AT KENT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-STRANG REPLACES HOOPER AT KENT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kent have signed Zimbabwe's test leg-spinner Paul Strang as their overseas player for the forthcoming English county season.</p>
<p>Strang, 26, replaces Guyanese all-rounder Carl Hooper, who would have been unavailable until mid-June because of the West Indies' scheduled two-test series with Sri Lanka.</p>
